      "sourceSemantics": "Reserves through durable inference.control, claims independently signed final-use authority only for a fresh request, records exact Core client-message/payload dispatch identity, invokes the private Agent/App Server, and settles matching observations. Reopen uses Core ReconcileOnly to recover the original turn or prove no durable admission; recovered terminal turns await exact-turn persisted usage replay under the RPC bound and never submit a replacement turn. The named long-lived local product owner revalidates the shared FinalUseAuthority before admission and during a run, applies live revocation updates concurrently, cancels and fences the generation on authority loss, and unloads resident models. Local cancellation sends an exact runtime cancel request, requires a matching terminal cancel acknowledgement by a bounded deadline, then kill/waits and returns indeterminate if terminality is not proven. Trusted exact-turn usage evidence can durably refine missing usage without replay or synthetic zero.",
